<p>What is the length of the unmeasured side of the triangle? <fillin characters="20"/></p>

</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>3</li></ul></p>
</answer>
<solution><p>Because it does not matter which leg is a and which is b we call the missing leg x.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}^{{2}}+{5.14}^{{2}}={5.95}^{{2}}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}^{{2}}+{26.4196}={35.4025}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}^{{2}}={35.4025}-{26.4196}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}^{{2}}={8.9829}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle\sqrt{{{x}^{{2}}}}=\sqrt{{{8.9829}}}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}\approx{3}</m>.</p></solution>
</myopenmath>